  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "In a large bowl, combine diced tomatoes, red onion, chopped cilantro, lime juice, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Mix well and let it sit for 15 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a kazan cauldron over medium heat.",
    "Add the tomato mixture to the cauldron and stir gently.",
    "Transfer the cauldron to the preheated oven and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the cauldron from the oven and let it cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve the pa amb tomaquet hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
